          "quote": "(field (name \"MPN\") \"FRC0805J240TSD\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(description \" 125mW Thick Film Resistors 150V ±1% ±5% 24Ω 0805 Chip Resistor"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"R90\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"R90\") (pin \"2\")"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the MPN determines the fitted value, R90 will load the VOUTP–VOUTN supply at 24Ω rather than 24kΩ. That can cause excessive current and resistor heating, potentially preventing the supply from operating or damaging the resistor and upstream circuitry.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "summary": "R90's schematic value is 24kΩ, but its MPN and description identify a 24Ω resistor. This substantial sourcing/value mismatch across VOUTP and VOUTN could heavily load the supply."
}

